OL,3,GNEWSACharity to host group dog walks
OL,4,Afor mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FDogs owners have been invited to talk
OL,7,Fpart in a charity dog walk to raise
OL,8,Fmoney to support mental health.
OL,10,FGuernsey Mind said caring for a pet
OL,11,Fcould help boost mental health through
OL,12,Fencouraging physical exercise and
OL,13,Fproviding companionship.
OL,15,FThe charity said it wanted to celebrate
OL,16,Fthis by inviting local dogs and owners
OL,17,Fto the "Walkies with Guernsey Mind"
OL,18,Fevent on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
