OL,3,GNEWSACharity to host group dog walks
OL,4,Afor mental health
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the charity said: "Our
OL,7,Fpets are great listeners who never
OL,8,Fjudge, and they can even help us meet
OL,9,Fnew people."
